  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TWOWS 2007-2010</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TWOWS 2007-2010</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TWOWS ger stipendier till unga kvinnor fr&#xE5;n Afrika s&#xF6;der om Sahara och LDC f&#xF6;r att kunna bedriva forskarstudier inom basvetenskaperna matematik, fysik, kemi och biologi samt inom vissa tv&#xE4;rvetenskapliga &#xE4;mnen som biokemi och medicin. Studierna bedrivs vid universitet i Syd exempelvis i Kina, Malaysia, Kenya, Sydafrika.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TWOWS has been supported by Sida since 1999. TWOWS provides  fellowships to young female students from sub-Saharan Africa and LDC&apos;s to carry out PhD-studies in basic sciences as well as  interdisciplinary fields such as biochemistry, medicine etc at centres of excellence in the south (as an example Ghana, Kenya, Malaysia, Nigeria, South Africa and Sri Lanka).</narrative>
  </description>
